flowchart LR
  Shopper[Shopper] --> UI[Two-column JTV workspace]
  UI --> SDK[InstantSearch Chat SDK]
  SDK --> ChatAPI[Application /api/chat proxy]
  ChatAPI --> Agent[One Agent Studio Concierge]
  Agent -->|native tool| Search[algolia_search_index]
  Search --> Indexes[(Indexes configured on the agent: prod_catalog, blog, help_content)]
  Indexes --> Agent
  Agent -->|native tool| Grouped[algolia_grouped_results]
  Grouped --> Cards[Workspace cards, one column per group]
  Cards --> UI
  UI --> Refresh[Exact-ID refresh API]
  Refresh --> Product[(prod_catalog, read-only)]
  UI --> State[Per-tab session state]
